  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PMTCT in public sector - India (01-Oct-2015-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India, HIV, Plan International (India Chapter) (Plan India)This program has the following goals: Provide comprehensive care and support to all persons living with HIV/AIDS and treatment services for all those who require it..  Reduce new infections by 50% (2007 Baseline of NACP III). The objectives of this program are: To improve coverage of PMTCT services through enhanced access in public and private sector moving towards elimnation of pediatric HIV and keeping mothers alive and healthy</narrative>
  </description>
